XTENSION= 'BINTABLE'           / binary table extension                         BITPIX  =                    8 / 8-bit bytes                                    NAXIS   =                    2 / 2-dimensional binary table                     NAXIS1  =                 8270 / width of table in bytes                        NAXIS2  =                   12 / number of rows in table                        PCOUNT  =                    0 / size of special data area                      GCOUNT  =                    1 / one data group (required keyword)              TFIELDS =                    3 / number of fields in each row                   TTYPE1  = 'MODE_ID '           / Mode identifier                                TFORM1  = 'B       '           / format of field                                TTYPE2  = 'PATTERN '           / Pattern                                        TFORM2  = 'B       '           / format of field                                TTYPE3  = 'THRESH_LOSS'        / The threshold loss for each energy             TFORM3  = '2067E   '           / format of field                                EXTNAME = 'THRESH_LOSS'        / The name of this table                         END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             